    {
      "text": "Vapor pressure needs a stated temperature and unit.",
      "startWordIndex": 0,
      "endWordIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "The source uses millipascals.",
      "startWordIndex": 8,
      "endWordIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "One millipascal equals 0.001 pascals,",
      "startWordIndex": 12,
      "endWordIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "while a pascal is one newton per square meter.",
      "startWordIndex": 18,
      "endWordIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "Dropping the prefix changes the value by a factor of a thousand.",
      "startWordIndex": 27,
      "endWordIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not compare mmHg and mPa without a correct conversion.",
      "startWordIndex": 39,
      "endWordIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray drift can involve droplets carried away from the target.",
      "startWordIndex": 49,
      "endWordIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "text": "Volatilization transfers substance to the gas phase.",
      "startWordIndex": 59,
      "endWordIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "text": "Airborne movement is not one mechanism,",
